OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm to consult on
OL,4,Adesalination plans by 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water has revealed more
OL,7,Finformation about proposals for two
OL,8,Fdesalination plants in a bid to secure
OL,9,Fwater supplies for the region.
OL,11,FIn January, the company awarded a #29m
OL,12,Fcontract to partnership TYPSA-Stantec -
OL,13,Fdesalination and engineering firms - to
OL,14,Fdevelop plans for the plants in Norfolk
OL,15,Fand Lincolnshire.
OL,17,FAnglian Water said that, without
OL,18,Fintervention, it estimated a daily
OL,19,Fshortfall of approximately half of the
OL,20,Fcurrent volume of water entering the
OL,21,Fnetwork by 2050, in what is the "driest
OL,22,Fand fastest growing" region of the UK.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
