OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm to consult on
OL,4,Adesalination plans by 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The benefits of seawater desalination
OL,7,Fare that it provides a
OL,8,Fclimate-resilient source of water,"
OL,9,Fsaid Anglian Water.
